{
    "title": "Sketch Art: Drawing AR & Paint",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf1fUnleash your creativity in a whole new drawing app: Sketch Art: Drawing AR & Paint\r\nEver dreamed of seeing your drawings come alive in the real world? Sketch Art: Drawing AR & Paint transforms your environment into a vibrant canvas, letting you create stunning masterpieces that interacts seamlessly with your \r\ndraw sketch in the real world.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0fWith Sketch Art: Drawing AR & Paint, you can:</b>\r\n\ud83c\udfa8Trace drawing into a stunning masterpieces\r\n\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0fEasily draw trace\r\n\ud83c\udfa8Improve your drawing skills\r\n\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0fSatisfied your artistic ambitions\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0fIn this AR drawing app, you can:</b>\r\n\ud83c\udfa8Choose from a variety of colors, shapes, and brushes and drawing your own pictures\r\n\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0fAdjust the size, opacity, and rotation of your drawing ideas\r\n\ud83c\udfa8Save and load your AR sketch drawings\r\n\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0fEasily create stunning masterpieces with many drawing tutorials and drawing step by step\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0fThis AR sketch paint tool feature include:</b>\r\n\ud83c\udfa8Use your phone camera to draw\r\n\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f10+ tracing templates with hundreds trace projected pictures\r\n\ud83c\udfa8Built-in flashlight\r\n\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0fSave your stunning drawing sketch paint in the gallery\r\n\ud83c\udfa8Record video for your the stunning masterpieces painting process\r\n\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0fMake a sketch and paint the drawing ideas\r\n\ud83c\udfa8Share with your friends\r\n\r\nLet's satisfied your artistic ambitions with this real time drawing AR editing learn to draw app. We hope this drawing tracing app can elicitate your emulous in create stunning masterpieces of drawing.\r\nWe\u2019d very much appreciate if you have any recommendations or suggestions for us to improve this drawing ideas app. Your kind words encourage us a lot, thank you \u2764\ufe0f",
